# Anger of the Gods: "deals 3 damage to each creature. If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn, exile it
# instead." Bot1 has an Ornithopter (0/2) and a Spellskite (0/4); Bot2 has a Giant Cindermaw (4/3, exactly lethal), an Ajani
# Resolute and Moxen, which are no creatures. The Cindermaw and the Ornithopter, whoever controls them, are exiled instead of
# going to the graveyard (CR 614.1a); the Spellskite survives 3 damage (toughness 4) but, dealt damage this way, is exiled
# when Lightning Bolt then kills it the same turn (CR 700.4). Ajani keeps all its loyalty.

